1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,970
(Leonard:)Hey, guys,
what do you think?

2
00:00:02,970 --> 00:00:04,430
(Leonard:)Priya took me
clothes shopping.

3
00:00:04,430 --> 00:00:05,650
(Penny:)Hey, you look great.

4
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:06,800
(Penny:)Good for you, Priya.

5
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,770
(Penny:)I could never get that stupid
hoodie off him

6
00:00:08,770 --> 00:00:09,740
(Penny:)when we were...

7
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:10,870
(Penny:)Well, you look great.

8
00:00:10,870 --> 00:00:12,310
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

9
00:00:12,310 --> 00:00:13,940
(Priya:)Lets go hang
everything up.

10
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:15,360
(Leonard:)Yeah, good.

11
00:00:17,110 --> 00:00:18,650
(Leonard:)New contacts.

12
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:20,980
(Leonard:)I should have done this
years ago.

13
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:26,520
