them doing it on a daily basis?

14
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:27,660
(Penny:)I'm not going out with him.

15
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:29,130
(Penny:)He can sleep
with whoever he wants.

16
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:31,860
(Howard:)Yeah, I was talking to Raj.

17
