19
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:40,900
(Howard:)Fine. Get another deck

20
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:42,240
(Howard:)and I'll do
the trick with that.

21
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:43,840
(Sheldon:)So you're saying this is
a regulation deck?

22
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:46,740
(Howard:)I'm saying believe in magic,
you muggle.

23
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:53,220
(Penny:)You know, well, I'm happy
Leonard's found someone.

24
00:00:55,390 --> 00:01:02,020
(Penny:)Not that anybody asked.

